<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Storage Dimensions.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Storage Dimensions.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Smith Barney analyst Barry Bosak initiated coverage of Storage Dimensions Inc with a buy rating, setting a 12-month price target of $13 on the stock, his office confirmed.</p>
<p>-- Set earnings per share estimates of $0.70 for 1997 and $1.08 for 1998.</p>
<p>-- The stock closed Wednesday at 6-1/2.</p>
</text>
